    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just everything. the jobs, the people, the constant noise in my head. it feels like i'm running a race that never actually ends and there's no finish line. i look at people just going through the motions and i feel so far away from them. like i've already checked out, i just haven't actually left yet. it's just so heavy.",
